    "question": "Jade and Krista went on a road trip for 3 days. On each day Jade had to drive 8 hours and Krista had to drive 6 hours to arrive at the destination. How many hours did they drive altogether?",
    "gold": "42",
    "answer": "Jade drives for a total of 3 days x 8 hours/day = <<3*8=24>>24 hours\nKrista drives for a total of 3 days x 6 hours/day = <<3*6=18>>18 hours\nTogether they drive 24 hours + 18 hours = <<24+18=42>>42 hours\n#### 42"
  },
